   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Autopilot bots complete the other ~99% of synthetic stops so the ops numbers keep moving.\nThe Pilot simulator (/pilot) is separate: it uses the same engine (economics.ts, pilot.ts) to show Bonus vs Control, break-even and GO / RE-PRICE / KILL.\nReal rider phone numbers and AWBs are never used. Every screen says: synthetic data, not an official Valmo app.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Autopilot bots complete the other ~99% of synthetic stops so the ops numbers keep moving.\nThe Pilot simulator (/pilot) is separate: it uses the same engine (economics.ts, pilot.ts) to show Bonus vs Control, break-even and GO / RE-PRICE / KILL.\nReal rider phone numbers and AWBs are never used. Every screen says: synthetic data, not an official Valmo app.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
